{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早晨的親吻」也越來越狂熱。", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啾咕、噗、噗啾嚕、嗯呼、咕啾囉、咕啾、噗啾、噗啾……」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2496", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～安潔……」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「主人……啊姆、嗯呼、啾、嗯呼、噗啾……嗯嗯……」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2497", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當我也抱住她之後，親吻已經升級到唇舌交纏吸吮的程度了。", "text_idx": 491, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然眼睛還沒有睜開，但是我知道自己已經陶醉得雙頰通紅。", "text_idx": 514, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過，今天又特別地……", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊……」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2498", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸嘿，早安，主人。」", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2499", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早安……咦？安潔？」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，今天也是主人喜歡的安潔喔！」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2500", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀～說出來了～欸嘿、欸嘿嘿、主人主人～」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2501", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃、嗯，我也最喜歡妳了，安潔。」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還被主人這樣說了！啊啊安潔從一大早就要昇天了……」", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2502", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「昇天之前可以回答我一個問題嗎？」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔喜歡的主人的臉，是想睡覺的時候的表情呢……」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2503", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是不是比平常的時間早很多？」", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2504", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，比平常多了３成的啾啾喔。」", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2505", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對不起主人！您說的沒錯！」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2506", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔。」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2507", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「再加２成。」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯姆……！？啾、姆啾、嗯呼。」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2508", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼啊、姆啾、啾啾、主人……」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2509", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像真的要昇天了……主人的親吻是１０成的等級……」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2510", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，抱歉抱歉，忍不住就興起了。」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為這個原因，我們今天比平常更早就出門了。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "順帶一提，櫻乃說完「再睡１０分鐘」的聲明後就回自己房間了。", "text_idx": 516, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "希望她可以順利起床。冬天的回籠覺是很可怕的喔，妹妹……", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以……安潔。」", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2511", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「讓您配合安潔真的很對不起。」", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2512", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果讓妳一個人先出門，那或許的確很抱歉。」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「丟下心愛的主人那種事，安潔罪該萬死的。」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2513", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以才讓您早起了。啊啊，愛情真是種罪過啊……」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2514", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為妳接受我的１０成親吻了，所以不管多早我都會陪妳的。」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過，為什麼今天要這麼早去學校呢？」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒錯，安潔提早叫醒我就是為了讓我盡早去學校。", "text_idx": 487, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個、就是啊。」", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2515", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔害羞地紅了臉。", "text_idx": 474, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她扭扭捏捏的，雙手的指尖互戳了好一會──", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「其實，安潔是想要站在校門口迎接各位同學。」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2516", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──竹掃帚清掃落葉的聲音，刷、刷、刷地回響在冬日的天空下。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2517", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔，來了呢……」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「歡迎回來～～！」", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2518", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咦？是安潔！？」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ja0061", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真是好久不見的景象了。", "text_idx": 493, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔就像以前的每天早上那樣，帶著竹掃帚笑臉歡迎到校的學生們。", "text_idx": 475, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「歡迎回來！」", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2519", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "結女生徒３年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，安潔……我回來了……」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "結女學生3年級", "alt_speaker_idx": 496, "voice": "jt0001", "char_id": "結女生徒３年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「歡迎回來～♪」", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2520", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔哇，感覺好久沒聽到了！！」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "sb0050", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一個又一個到校的學生。", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔有朝氣地對所有人打招呼，大家雖然驚訝地瞪大眼睛，但都回應了她。", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "結女生徒１年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇、安潔在呢！」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "結女學生1年級", "alt_speaker_idx": 495, "voice": "jo0001", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，歡迎回來！」", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2521", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "結女生徒１年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，就是要這樣才對呢！早上就是想聽到這句啊～」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "結女學生1年級", "alt_speaker_idx": 495, "voice": "jo0002", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？是安潔和瓜生啊。」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": "da0047", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，早安。」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「歡迎回來，呵呵～」", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2522", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈，喔！我回來了！」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": "da0048", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不分年級和原本的學校，更不分性別。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在旁邊看著的我也不禁感到愉快。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、歡迎回來～」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2523", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「應該是我們才覺得安潔回來了呢！」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": "jc0057", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈、早安！」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早、早安……瓜生君也在啊……」", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": "jc0058", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，安潔溫柔的主人陪著安潔喔～討厭啦～」", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2524", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀啊呀啊、安潔真是個幸福的人！感受到愛對吧～真是受不了呢～」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2525", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，還附贈放閃啊……那就有點尷尬了……」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": "jc0059", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過，是怎麼了？突然就回來了。」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": "jc0060", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸嘿嘿……」", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2526", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔和我對看一眼，然後開心地笑了。", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對於促成我們兩人結合的學校的各位。」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2527", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「現在的安潔想要對各位感謝報恩。」", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2528", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……也就是說。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這個行為就是表達了安潔心中與我結合的喜悅。", "text_idx": 508, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸嘿……沒有錯吧～主人！」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2529", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "能夠做這件事也讓她很高興。她看著身旁的我，笑容散發出光彩。", "text_idx": 506, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這讓我也跟著高興。", "text_idx": 511, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這女孩想要這樣「報恩」的心情，我非常瞭解。", "text_idx": 509, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以？明天還會繼續嗎？」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "ar4107", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "午休時間。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家一起吃著午飯，瀨名同學發出疑問。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「考試都結束了，還這麼辛苦啊。」", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "sn0384", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為安潔跟紗凪不同，考得還不錯，所以才有餘裕做這種事吧？」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "ar4108", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我什～麼都沒聽到～」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "sn0385", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "順帶一提，上午已經公布了考試結果。有人進步也有人退步。", "text_idx": 515, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟安潔是小有進步，所以被瀨名同學（她依然是不變的年級榜首）誇獎了。", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果妳想繼續的話，我明天也會陪妳的。」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝您。」", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2530", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是連續幾天讓主人早起安潔覺得很抱歉。」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2531", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%51;「我只要有那個吻就好了。」", "text_idx": 8, "plain": "「我只要有那個吻就好了。」", "plain_idx": 410, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%51;「那樣的話反倒是安潔的身體會受不了的……」", "text_idx": 9, "plain": "「那樣的話反倒是安潔的身體會受不了的……」", "plain_idx": 454, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2532", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了夠了！不要在大家面前親熱！你們這種戀愛腦的傢伙！」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "sn0386", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼欸？只是普通的對話啊……」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2533", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咕……這傢伙，剛才那種只是小兒科嗎……？」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "sn0387", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵，你們兩個人的水準確實提高了呢。」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "mu0430", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我們的精神耐力不跟著提高的話，很快就會變得沒辦法一起吃飯了……」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "ar4109", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我已經習慣了，隨便你們說都可以。」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 485, "voice": "sk1012", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「太可靠了，這下安潔稍微放心了。」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2534", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃、我們也稍微注意一下吧，安潔……」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自從第一次愛愛之後，我們的閃光度真的越來越刺眼了……", "text_idx": 507, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咳咳……雖然早上的校門口迎接原本只打算復活一天。」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原本約好是這樣，我繼續說下去。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是安潔，妳並不想就這樣結束吧？」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……您看出來了嗎？」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2535", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當然了，我是妳的主人啊。」", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "應該說早上那只是開端，看得出來安潔「還感謝不夠」的心情。", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且我也是一樣。", "text_idx": 504, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……因為是如此快樂的事。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「況且大家都很高興。」", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2536", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以會繼續進行感謝啊。」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 513, "voice": "ht0375", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那接下來要做什麼？」", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 513, "voice": "ht0376", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「照順序來看，是請慢走？」", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 485, "voice": "sk1013", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那也不錯呢～」", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2537", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是、這個……該怎麼說呢，要做的話還是『決定版！』的感覺比較好呢。」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2538", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "很像喜歡熱鬧的安潔會說的話。", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原來如此，既然這樣……」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～也不能像以前那樣在學校裡到處工作呢。」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那樣的話事情就變得複雜了。」", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "ar4110", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也是……會讓好不容易統整好的體制又變回去。」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "現在的安潔主要是透過我來參與學校的工作，這是不久前我們建立起來的制度。", "text_idx": 489, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而目前沒有什麼工作呢。應該說，是正在努力適應不派工作給安潔。」", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「組織改善委員會本身，現在也沒有工作嗎？」", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "mu0431", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為有期末考啊。」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之，一邊擬定暫定方案，然後寒假中集合幾次正式開始運作的感覺吧～」", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 513, "voice": "ht0377", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「姆姆。」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2539", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對喔，再一週這學期就要結束了呢……」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2540", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聽到隼太說到寒假，安潔一臉煩惱地開始思考。", "text_idx": 505, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是顧慮得太多都不行動，恐怕會就這樣直到休業式了。」", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2541", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最糟糕的情況呢……」", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但可能性不低。」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 485, "voice": "sk1014", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今年是２１日休業式對吧？什麼嘛，不知不覺中就快到了啊～」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "sn0388", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「聖誕節和過年也很快就來了呢。小熊喵，想要什麼禮物呢？」", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "mu0432", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕～！」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "pn0121", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「絕對不會把主人給妳！」「哥哥是安潔的所以不給。」", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔／櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": "go073", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「反正都是瓜生，小櫻乃也算吧？」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 513, "voice": "ht0378", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我的話就可以。」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 485, "voice": "sk1016", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以嗎！？」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "ar4111", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那聖誕節就請小櫻乃來開特別準備的貓罐頭吧。」", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "mu0433", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「儘管來吧。」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 485, "voice": "sk1017", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～♪」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "pn0122", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "畢竟是特別的節日，大家的話題轉移到了聖誕節。", "text_idx": 490, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這是把安潔接回家後的第一個聖誕節。我也不想過得太隨便。", "text_idx": 510, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "除了想安潔報恩感謝的方法，也要考慮一下那天的準備呢……", "text_idx": 512, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………啊。」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當我將兩件事並排在腦海中時，我突然想到一個點子。", "text_idx": 492, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對了，安潔。報恩的事這樣做如何？」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 154, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔喔，請告訴安潔……」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2543", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 155, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼嗯呼嗯……」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2544", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 156, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊啊！主人，就是這個、這個！！」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ag2545", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
